OL,3,CProbation officers threaten to strike
OL,4,Cin protest against early release scheme
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FBut Napo said the money must go
OL,12,Ftowards improving conditions for
OL,13,Fprobation staff.
OL,15,FMr Cockburn continued: "Promises of
OL,16,Fextra investment are starting to sound
OL,17,Flike snake oil when we have heard them
OL,18,Fso many times before.
OL,26,@wD@XOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
