OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786493896
OL,3,CProbation officers threaten to strike
OL,4,Cin protest against early release scheme
OL,6,F"We have been told about hundreds,
OL,7,Fthen thousands, of new recruits. But
OL,8,Fhow many qualified, stayed, or later
OL,9,Fleft because workloads, pay and
OL,10,Fconditions became unbearable?
OL,12,F"You cannot recruit your way out of a
OL,13,Fretention crisis while leaving the
OL,14,Funderlying problems untouched.
OL,16,F"Our members have now delivered an
OL,17,Foverwhelming verdict. They are saying
OL,18,Fenough is enough."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUxD@AOUzD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
