OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786493896
OL,3,CProbation officers threaten to strike
OL,4,Cin protest against early release scheme
OL,6,FA Ministry of Justice spokesperson
OL,7,Fsaid: "Our probation staff do a vital
OL,8,Fjob, working tirelessly to cut crime
OL,9,Fand keep the public safe.
OL,11,F"That is why we secured the biggest
OL,12,Fprobation pay increase in over a
OL,13,Fdecade in April and are working to cut
OL,14,Fdown workloads by recruiting 1,300
OL,15,Fprobation officers this year and
OL,16,Finvesting in technology that can drive
OL,17,Fdown admin workloads.
OL,26,@oD@GOUsD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31808
