CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786493896
OL,3,CProbation officers threaten to strike
OL,4,Cin protest against early release scheme
OL,6,F"While this ballot is only indicative,
OL,7,Fwe are disappointed with the outcome
OL,8,Fand will continue to engage with Napo
OL,9,Fand other recognised trade unions."
OL,11,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham paused the
OL,12,Fearly release scheme last month in the
OL,13,Fface of a public outcry over the
OL,14,Fpotential early release of the killers
OL,15,Fof PC Andrew Harper.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
