CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786493896
OL,3,CProbation officers threaten to strike
OL,4,Cin protest against early release scheme
OL,6,FPrisoners serving sentences for rape
OL,7,For child sex offences will be exempt
OL,8,Ffrom the changes, and Burnham pushed
OL,9,Fback the date when the first early
OL,10,Freleases would begin, from September
OL,11,Fto October, to give the Probation
OL,12,FService more time to prepare.
OL,14,FBurnham has now ordered Justice
OL,15,FSecretary Alex Norris to find a way to
OL,16,Fprevent the early release of PC
OL,17,FHarper's killers.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
